    <briefdescription>
<para>A handy container for a FunctionType+Callee-pointer pair, which can be passed around as a single entity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This assists in replacing the use of PointerType::getElementType() to access the function&apos;s type, since that&apos;s slated for removal as part of the [opaque pointer types] project. </para>
